  unitName: Supreme Chol Arus
  unitId: 10557
  unitNumber: 1537
  description: Legend holds that humans who fell to Ishgria were destined to die
    or be absorbed by evil energies, becoming something inhuman. However, someone
    like Arus, who possessed a tenacious heart, unyielding power, and strong bonds
    of affection, might have been able to return without dying or being consumed
    by evil. Though there's no telling what combination of happy chances might have
    returned Arus to Grand Gaia, this scholar would prefer to believe that he and
    his queen made the journey back.
  summonDesc: I'll never give up hope, no matter how rough the situation is. I have
    someone I have to keep safe.
  fusionDesc: A use for my strength?<br>I feel like I finally understand.<br>It's
    all right, my mind is clear now.
  evoDesc: We survived, thanks to my comrades' sacrifices. And that's why I'm going
    to make it back!!
  element: 1
  rarity: 7
